# TMDB (films + shows, incl. anime) — REST.
#
# Auth: use the v4 "API Read Access Token" as a Bearer header (recommended over
# the older v3 api_key query param). Get it at:
#   themoviedb.org -> Settings -> API -> "API Read Access Token".
# Put it in http-client.private.env.json as `tmdbAccessToken`.
#
# Images are served separately: build a URL as
#   https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500<poster_path>
# where <poster_path> comes from the JSON (e.g. "/abc123.jpg").

### Search movies by title
GET https://api.themoviedb.org/3/search/movie?query=blade%20runner&include_adult=false
Authorization: Bearer {{tmdbAccessToken}}

### Search TV shows by title (covers anime series too)
GET https://api.themoviedb.org/3/search/tv?query=breaking&bad&include_adult=false
Authorization: Bearer {{tmdbAccessToken}}

### Multi-search (movies + TV + people in one call)
GET https://api.themoviedb.org/3/search/multi?query=akira&include_adult=false
Authorization: Bearer {{tmdbAccessToken}}

### Movie details by id (append_to_response pulls extras in one request)
GET https://api.themoviedb.org/3/movie/78?append_to_response=credits,keywords
Authorization: Bearer {{tmdbAccessToken}}

### TV show details by id
GET https://api.themoviedb.org/3/tv/1429?append_to_response=credits
Authorization: Bearer {{tmdbAccessToken}}

### Configuration (image base_url + available sizes — fetch once, cache it)
GET https://api.themoviedb.org/3/configuration
Authorization: Bearer {{tmdbAccessToken}}
